


 Minutes of the FIGGY BAR RT Conference.

Date: 05/03/90   Time: 22:29EDT
  
  The question of the night was:'Are you a member of FIG ? SigForth ACM ? Is
  the GEnie Forth RoundTable serving your needs ?' What got hotly discussed
  was Forth's place (or lack of place) in Computer Science and FIG's place
  (or lack of place) with respect to that. There are no answers in this
  transcript. There is debate !!!

